        "description": "The objective is to learn the basics of the Japanese language and how to communicate in Japanese. The students will acquire a primary understanding of Japan through studying Japanese culture. 1) The students should attend the classes regularly, and before attending the class they should study the required vocabulary using the provided video and the textbook. 2) The students should submit homework regularly. 3) Class tests will be conducted in every class, and the marks will be added to the results of the Final Test. 4) This course is a Hybrid course (Offline / Online).",
